                    },
                    "message": "Again, we need \"why\" and not \"what\".\n\nWhy are we requiring \"AC cycle\"?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 9,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alex-TS-Wang",
                        "email": "alex.ts.wang@fii-foxconn.com",
                        "username": "Alex-TS-Wang"
                    },
                    "message": "The current chassis power cycle function behavior is implemented through the power button to restart the host, not a real chassis power cycle.\n\nThis commit is aimed at fixing the incorrect behavior by using the I2C bus to configure the CPLD to achieve the real chassis power cycle behavior."
                },
